                            </div>
                            <div class="dropdown-item" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:2px">
                                <span style="font-weight:500;font-size:0.8125rem"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-from-bracket"></i> Upload your matric results</span>
